1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
The numbers on your tire

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
aren't random.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
First group: width,

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
ratio, wheel size. 225/60R17.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Then the load index —

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
a low one can be under-rated.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Last, the speed-rating letter.

8
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Mixing them is worth checking.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Photo your sidewall before you shop.

10
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Nick's Tire & Auto reads it with you. Link in bio.
